    {
      "id": "rX8SYxdIloLKM3h-yKdwG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1224.408540610591,
      "y": 2887.019743370267,
      "width": 653.0946044921875,
      "height": 776.2069778968781,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "bI7tSdBKY0xI_5JzvSrBh"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 245958484,
      "version": 3029,
      "versionNonce": 1176918768,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786462004829,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# AGENTS.md\n\n## Build & Test\n- Build: `npm run build`\n- Test all: `npm test`\n- Test single: `npm test -- --grep \"test name\"`\n- Lint: `npm run lint`\n\n## Code Style\n- Use TypeScript strict mode\n- Prefer `const` over `let`\n- Avoid `try/catch` where possible\n- Single-word variable names preferred\n\n## Architecture\n- API handlers in `src/api/handlers/`\n- Database models in `src/models/`\n- Avoid circular dependencies\n\n## Testing\n- Avoid mocks when possible\n- Test actual implementation",
      "fontSize": 28.225708287159204,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# AGENTS.md\n\n## Build & Test\n- Build: `npm run build`\n- Test all: `npm test`\n- Test single: `npm test -- --grep \"test name\"`\n- Lint: `npm run lint`\n\n## Code Style\n- Use TypeScript strict mode\n- Prefer `const` over `let`\n- Avoid `try/catch` where possible\n- Single-word variable names preferred\n\n## Architecture\n- API handlers in `src/api/handlers/`\n- Database models in `src/models/`\n- Avoid circular dependencies\n\n## Testing\n- Avoid mocks when possible\n- Test actual implementation",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0Jjl",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "LWRnRwiLxMA-XY_VgZhjk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1970.9840614439242,
      "y": 2895.847868370267,
      "width": 790.294189453125,
      "height": 423.38562430738807,
