      "updated": 1786462004829,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔵 Skill (Receita)\n\nQuando: sob demanda, ao casar a tarefa\nDá: know-how de um processo\nTraz scripts, references, assets",
      "fontSize": 31.633035714285764,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔵 Skill (Receita)\n\nQuando: sob demanda, ao casar a tarefa\nDá: know-how de um processo\nTraz scripts, references, assets",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
